# Non-static monitor functions that are unreachable from main() in EVERY configuration the
# pre-push gate links (scripts/run_warning_gate.sh --push: default x86, DEBUG + shared-node
# x86, aarch64 Grace). A name here is accepted; any new name fails the gate. A function only
# ARM, DEBUG or shared-node code calls is reachable and never belongs here.
#
# The gate prints entries that some configuration reaches, or that no configuration defines,
# as stale: remove them. Remove a name when you delete or start calling that function.

